0..69 Comment "// `Eq.generic` where it derives nothing: a field with no equality, a"
70..132 Comment "// type the derivation does not yet cover, the derivation read"
133..208 Comment "// anywhere but as a definition\'s whole body, and a stated type the derived"
209..287 Comment "// equality does not meet. Its laws refuse a field of a sum, whose proof cases"
288..354 Comment "// on the field under a motive, and a recursion, whose proof is an"
355..368 Comment "// induction."
